Traditional-Chinese copy of the JevBench public Tasks (easy.jsonl, original.jsonl, hard.jsonl)

These files are derived from the public Tasks of JevBench
(https://github.com/fstandhartinger/jevbench) at commit
609a664e81f46e03731600bd7bd9f1b7a61257c5: datasets/public/easy.jsonl, original.jsonl and
hard.jsonl. Each Task's State has been translated into Traditional Chinese (Taiwan usage); every
other field of every Task is unchanged.

